      "abstractNote": "This release includes the machine learning models, embeddings, and evaluation results from the OntoClue project, which explores various text embedding techniques to evaluate document-to-document similarity in biomedical literature. The project leverages the RELISH Corpus, a curated dataset containing expert annotations of document pairs based on their relevance and similarity. This release features trained embedding models, the resulting embeddings, and the corresponding evaluation outcomes, including precision, cosine similarity and nDCG@N. For each approach there will 2 files corresponding to class distribution, and list all approach names. 3 vs 2 explanation",
